s-finish-line-6fc313e2-c7b3-4ea3-a7a4-79a875475ffd.html%3Fchunk%3D1%26utm_term%3Demshare%23story1\" style=\"display:inline-block;margin-left:7px\"><img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"border:0\" src=\"https://static.axios.com/img/axios-site/newsletters/logos/footer/share-email-circle-border.png\" alt=\"Email this Story\"></a> <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47549068.\" style=\"display:inline-block;margin-left:7px\"><img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"border:0\" src=\"https://static.axios.com/img/axios-site/newsletters/logos/footer/share-sms-circle-border.png\" alt=\"Text this Story\"></a></td></tr><tr>\r\n<td height=\"10\" style=\"height:10px;font-size:0;border-bottom:10px solid #f5f5f5\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>      \r\n<tr><td height=\"20\" style=\"height: 10px; font-size: 0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td class=\"ol-adpad\" style=\"padding: 20px 3.5% 0 3.5%;\"><p class=\"b\"\r\nstyle=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100% !important; margin-bottom: 0 !important; font-size: 11px !important; letter-spacing: 1.4px; color: #008dc8; font-weight:700;\"\r\n>\r\nA MESSAGE FROM AMERICA’S CREDIT UNIONS\r\n</p></td></tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"padding: 20px 3.5%; line-height: 1.5;\"><span class=\"b k\" style=\"font-size: 26px; color: #222222;  font-family: 'gorditamedium', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;  letter-spacing: -0.1px; line-height: 1.5;\">Putting opportunity within reach</span></td></tr>\r\n<tr><td height=\"10\" style=\"height: 10px; font-size: 0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n<a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47549068.\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://tpc.googlesyndication.com/pageadimg/imgad?id=CICAgJCVi4LfSRABGAEoATIIMobMIQ5qTgk\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" style=\"width:100%\" /></a>\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td height=\"15\" style=\"height: 15px; font-size: 0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td class=\"v\" style=\"padding: 0 3.5%; line-height: 1.75;  font-size: 17px; font-family: Georgia, serif; line-height: 1.75; color: #222222; letter-spacing: -0.1px;\">\r\n<p><strong>Bringing opportunity</strong> to communities often overlooked.</p>\r\n<p>Since the beginning, credit unions have kept the American Dream within reach for all, sometimes as the only financial institution within a 10-mile radius. Without them, rural and underserved communities would be left behind.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47549068.\" target=\"_blank\">Learn more.</a>\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td height=\"10\" style=\"height: 10px; font-size: 0; border-bottom: 10px solid #f5f5f5;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td height=\"10\" style=\"height:10px;font-size:0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr><tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding:20px 3.5% 10px;line-height:1.5\">\r\n<span class=\"b k\" style=\"font-size:27px;font-family:'gorditamedium',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#222;letter-spacing:-0.1px;line-height:1.5\">  2. 🏀 Legends vs. cancer </span>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>   <tr>\r\n<td height=\"10\" style=\"height:10px;font-size:0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr> <tr>\r\n<td class=\"v\" style=\"padding:0 3.5%;line-height:1.75;font-size:17px;font-family:Georgia,serif;color:#222;letter-spacing:-0.1px\"><div align=\"center\"><!--[if mso]><img alt='' src='https://images.axios.com/orO6zKQj6PKeIjxNvBIcHR215S8=/fit-in/1116x1300/2026/09/17/1789673766370.jpeg' style='display:block; margin: 0 auto; max-width:100%;' width='558' /><![endif]--><!--[if !mso]><!--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://images.axios.com/orO6zKQj6PKeIjxNvBIcHR215S8=/fit-in/1116x1300/2026/09/17/1789673766370.jpeg\" style=\"display:block; margin: 0 auto; max-width:100%;\" width=\"100%\"/><!--<![endif]--></div> <div class=\"bodytext\" style=\"font-size:13px; font-family:'Gordita',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color:#848484; margin-bottom:20px;\">Former Old Dominion Monarchs head coach Jeff Jones during a game against the VCU Rams in 2019. Photo: Ryan M. Kelly/Getty Images</div><p><strong>Since it began in 1993, </strong>Coaches vs. Cancer — a collaboration between the American Cancer Society and the National Association of Basketball Coaches — has raised hundreds of millions of dollars for cancer research.</p><ul><li><strong>Within that legacy </strong>sits the <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47549068.406679/aHR0cHM6Ly9oYW1wdG9ucm9hZHMuYWNzZ2FsYS5vcmcvP3V0bV9zb3VyY2U9bmV3c2xldHRlciZ1dG1fbWVkaXVtPWVtYWlsJnV0bV9jYW1wYWlnbj1uZXdzbGV0dGVyX2F4aW9zZmluaXNobGluZSZzdHJlYW09dG9w/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aB5a2f88ff\" target=\"_blank\">Legends Gala</a>, an annual event in Norfolk, Va., that last year raised close to $415,000.</li></ul><p>🥂 <strong>The gala </strong>is the brainchild of former Old Dominion University and UVA head coach <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47549068.406679/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuYXhpb3MuY29tLzIwMjYvMDMvMTEvamVmZi1qb25lcy1iYXNrZXRiYWxsLWNvYWNoLW1hcmNoLW1hZG5lc3M_dXRtX3NvdXJjZT1uZXdzbGV0dGVyJnV0bV9tZWRpdW09ZW1haWwmdXRtX2NhbXBhaWduPW5ld3NsZXR0ZXJfYXhpb3NmaW5pc2hsaW5lJnN0cmVhbT10b3A/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aB49e7d1c5\" target=\"_blank\">Jeff Jones</a>, who knows firsthand how ugly cancer is. Jones was diagnosed with prostate cancer in 2015, and complications from the cancer and its treatment have persisted, including eight ER visits this year, <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47549068.\" target=\"_blank\">he told The Virginian-Pilot</a>.</p><ul><li><strong>His wife, </strong>Axios senior adviser Danielle Decker Jones (DJ), tells us, \"I see what he endures, the daily ravages, and what he still manages to accomplish. And I know that he is a warrior.\"</li></ul><p><strong>Zoom in: </strong>The idea behind the Legends Gala was to bring iconic coaches and athletes together with Coaches vs. Cancer supporters. The success of last year's event earned Coach Jones ACS' prestigious <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47549068.406679/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuY2FuY2VyLm9yZy9pbnZvbHZlZC92b2x1bnRlZXIvYXdhcmRzL2hpc3RvcmljYWwtdm9sdW50ZWVyLWF3YXJkLXdpbm5lcnMuaHRtbD91dG1fc291cmNlPW5ld3NsZXR0ZXImdXRtX21lZGl1bT1lbWFpbCZ1dG1fY2FtcGFpZ249bmV3c2xldHRlcl9heGlvc2ZpbmlzaGxpbmUmc3RyZWFtPXRvcA/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aBfd55a6a9\" target=\"_blank\">Volunteer Leadership Award</a>.</p><ul><li><strong>This year's star lineup </strong>includes UConn women's head coach Geno Auriemma, UVA men's head coach Ryan Odom and former LA Chargers quarterback Taylor Heinicke. The gala is tomorrow evening.</li><li><a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47549068.406679/aHR0cHM6Ly9oYW1wdG9ucm9hZHMuYWNzZ2FsYS5vcmcvdGFibGVzLWRvbmF0aW9ucy8_dXRtX3NvdXJjZT1uZXdzbGV0dGVyJnV0bV9tZWRpdW09ZW1haWwmdXRtX2NhbXBhaWduPW5ld3NsZXR0ZXJfYXhpb3NmaW5pc2hsaW5lJnN0cmVhbT10b3A/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aB5bee00f9\" target=\"_blank\"><em>Donate to the American Cancer Society</em></a><em>.</em></li></ul></td>\r\n</tr> <tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 3.5% 25px\">   <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47549068.406679/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuZmFjZWJvb2suY29tL3NoYXJlci5waHA_dT1odHRwczovL3d3dy5heGlvcy5jb20vbmV3c2xldHRlcnMvYXhpb3MtZmluaXNoLWxpbmUtNmZjMzEzZTItYzdiMy00ZWEzLWE3YTQtNzlhODc1NDc1ZmZkLmh0bWw_Y2h1bmslM0QyJTI2dXRtX3Rlcm0lM0RmYnNvY2lhbHNoYXJlJTIzc3RvcnkyJnV0bV9zb3VyY2U9bmV3c2xldHRlciZ1dG1fbWVkaXVtPWVtYWlsJnV0bV9jYW1wYWlnbj1uZXdzbGV0dGVyX2F4aW9zZmluaXNobGluZSZzdHJlYW09dG9w/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aC1ea9f69a\" style=\"display:inline-block\"><img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"border:0\" src=\"https://static.axios.com/img/axios-site/newsletters/logos/footer/share-facebook-circle-border.png\" alt=\"Share on Facebook\"></a> <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47549068.406679/aHR0cHM6Ly90d2l0dGVyLmNvbS9pbnRlbnQvdHdlZXQ_\" style=\"display:inline-block;margin-left:7px\"><img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"border:0\" src=\"https://static.axios.com/img/axios-site/newsletters/logos/footer/share-x-circle-border.png\" alt=\"Tweet this Story\"></a> <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47549068.\" style=\"display:inline-block;margin-left:7px\"><img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"border:0\" src=\"https://static.axios.com/img/axios-site/newsletters/logos/footer/share-linkedin-circle-border.png\" alt=\"Po